<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia tax reform would boost growth, jobs-govt.</title>
<headline>Australia tax reform would boost growth, jobs-govt.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Prime Minister John Howard said on Thursday that tax reforms which cut business costs would boost economic growth and employment.</p>
<p>&quot;A tax system that reduces the cost of doing business and provides incentives to work and invest will obviously boost economic growth and that must be beneficial for jobs,&quot; Howard told parliament, answering a question about the need for tax reform.</p>
</text>
